@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### Kiem tra ket noi MongoDB
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create - tao san pham
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pid": "P001",
  "pname": "Ban phim",
  "price": 350000,
  "quantity": 10
}

### Read - danh sach san pham
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Read - tim theo pid
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/P001

### Update - gui du bon truong
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/P001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pid": "P001",
  "pname": "Ban phim co",
  "price": 500000,
  "quantity": 8
}

### Update - chi sua quantity
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/products/P001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 5
}

### Delete - xoa san pham
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/P001
